## FOI 4302 – AEMDS Preliminary Fatal Case Assessment

TGA document describing the preliminary assessment of fatal adverse event reports, including the criteria for referral to the Vaccine Safety Investigation Group (VSIG). Undated in the extract.

**Source:** https://www.tga.gov.au/sites/default/files/2023-05/foi-4302-01.PDF

**Evidentiary significance:** States that the VSIG should only be used in accordance with its criteria and, citing WHO guidance, that it is important to avoid "burning out" the panel. Relevant to Output 2.8 and to the Department's answer to QON 2328 (SQ25-003155). Also states that the VSIG is not required for the COVID-19 Vaccine Claims Scheme.

